F9E1                  (    forth6809.asm):06045         SUBSTITUTEW: ; REWRITE: was a plain substring search-and-replace on
                      (    forth6809.asm):06046                      ; the bare registered name (via SEARCHW), which found
                      (    forth6809.asm):06047                      ; "girl" and replaced only that span, leaving surrounding
                      (    forth6809.asm):06048                      ; "%...%" delimiters untouched in the output - and never
                      (    forth6809.asm):06049                      ; returned the substitution count ANS requires as a
                      (    forth6809.asm):06050                      ; third stack item. Per the ANS spec (forth-standard.org/
                      (    forth6809.asm):06051                      ; standard/string/SUBSTITUTE), SUBSTITUTE must scan for
                      (    forth6809.asm):06052                      ; text between '%' (ASCII $25) delimiter pairs
                      (    forth6809.asm):06053                      ; specifically: "%%" collapses to a single '%' (count
